<section id="vendor-analysis">
  <h2>厂商、产品与标签集中度</h2>
  <p>本节统计的是当前 KEV 快照中的厂商及产品标签，不代表厂商安全性、产品质量或实际受攻击概率。</p>
  <div class="metric-grid">
    <div class="metric"><span>CR5</span><strong>{{ "%.2f%%"|format(vendor.metrics.vendor_concentration.cr5 * 100) }}</strong></div>
    <div class="metric"><span>CR10</span><strong>{{ "%.2f%%"|format(vendor.metrics.vendor_concentration.cr10 * 100) }}</strong></div>
    <div class="metric"><span>HHI</span><strong>{{ "%.4f"|format(vendor.metrics.vendor_concentration.hhi) }}</strong></div>
  </div>
  {{ vendor.figure_html.vendor_top20 | safe }}
  {{ vendor.figure_html.vendor_product_top30 | safe }}
  {{ vendor.figure_html.vendor_pareto | safe }}
  {{ vendor.figure_html.vendor_ransomware | safe }}
</section>
